OL,3,ALive forever: Unheard Oasis recordings
OL,4,Ato be sold
OL,5,
OL,6,FOasis fans are set for a Wonderwall
OL,7,Fexperience when they get the chance to
OL,8,Fbid for unheard recordings of the
OL,9,FSupersonic boys at their peak.
OL,11,FThe archive includes recordings of 63
OL,12,Flive shows, soundchecks and more than
OL,13,F100 hours of rehearsals from the band's
OL,14,Frise and rise in the 1990s.
OL,16,FThe lots, which also include original
OL,17,Fsetlists, tour itineraries, a
OL,18,Fband-played Epiphone guitar and an
OL,19,FOasis tour parka, will be offered for
OL,20,Fsale on 3 October in Evesham,
OL,21,FWorcestershire.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,169,160,200,105,0,100
